//    This PR needs to wait for PR #5962 and PR #5959 to be merged first.
//    
//    Fix description: Route cross-page uncache data to S1 for unified
//    management. S3 can now directly concatenate uncache instructions using
//    s3_prevLastIsHalfRvi during fetch. This fixes the edge case where
//    instructions spanning both cache and uncache channels fell through the
//    cracks of the existing S1 (cache) and S3 (uncache) cross-page handling
//    logic.
